{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1228767-premade-scenarios","id":1228767,"title":"Premade scenarios?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-06-19T22:07:25-07:00","id":1228767,"title":"Premade scenarios?","content":"While I mostly prefer to make up my own scenarios, every now and then I like to throw in a premade, usually either because it's a really good one or because I need extra time to sort out a scenario I'm writing myself. I know 1st edition had the SAS scenarios, but were there any other premade scenarios for CoD and the various splats (particularly for Requiem)? Are there any rumours floating around about Onyx Path doing something like SAS for 2nd edition? I know premade scenarios must not be big sellers, but I for one would grab every one that gets released, either to run as-is or to use as inspiration for my own scenarios. heck, being good sources for npc stats alone makes premade scenarios worth every penny.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13542-shadowdragon","name":"Shadowdragon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-19T22:32:30-07:00","id":1228775,"title":"","content":"There was Reap the Whirlwind, which was a first edition SAS updated to second edition rules. All of the other stuff is in first edition. The Chicago book had a story for each of the main three game lines, as well as substantial setting building for them. I believe each of the main three, as well as mortal, had quickstart adventures as well. Promethean had a pre-made adventure through its first edition books, I believe Mummy has a lot of scenarios in their books too.<br /> <br /> No idea about SAS for second edition but I don't exactly have my finger on the pulse of rumors. Though I'd love it if they did.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-20T11:03:14-07:00","id":1228906,"title":"","content":"There's a CtL2 jumpstart in first drafts right now, it was a stretch goal from the Kickstarter.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Meghan Fitzgerald | Onyx Path freelance writer &amp; developer</i><br /> <span style=\"color:#008000\"><i>Changeling: The Lost developer</i></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#009999\"><i>Mage: The Awakening developer</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2229-meghan-fitzgerald","name":"Meghan Fitzgerald","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2229_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"124"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-20T17:33:13-07:00","id":1229027,"title":"","content":"I've ported a handful of 1e SAS stories to 2e, it's mostly pretty straightforward to do. That said, I'd love to see more new scenarios written specifically for 2e.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-20T22:08:57-07:00","id":1229081,"title":"","content":"Hopefully we will also get some out of the Geist 2e, Hunter 2e, Mummy 2e, and Deviant Kickstarters just like we are from Changeling. Getting a QuickStart out of Contagion would also be nice.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-21T22:00:32-07:00","id":1229296,"title":"","content":"I kind of wish Onyx Path would open up Chronicles of Darkness to third party content creators. I know there must be issues with New White Wolf, but I think it would be of tremendous benefit. I've heard before that things like city books and scenario books aren't big sellers and are often not worth the time and money to produce, but what if other people made those city and scenario books, freeing Onyx Path to continue focusing on core stuff like splat and expansion books? Onyx Path starting up their own Storyteller's Vault would be tremendous. I can only imagine the vast hoard of premade adventures we'd get from something like that, as well as everything else.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13542-shadowdragon","name":"Shadowdragon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-21T22:15:00-07:00","id":1229301,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shadowdragon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1228767-premade-scenarios?p=1229296#post1229296\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I kind of wish Onyx Path would open up Chronicles of Darkness to third party content creators. I know there must be issues with New White Wolf, but I think it would be of tremendous benefit. I've heard before that things like city books and scenario books aren't big sellers and are often not worth the time and money to produce, but what if other people made those city and scenario books, freeing Onyx Path to continue focusing on core stuff like splat and expansion books? Onyx Path starting up their own Storyteller's Vault would be tremendous. I can only imagine the vast hoard of premade adventures we'd get from something like that, as well as everything else.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd like to see the same thing, but I'm 95% sure that decision is entirely in the hands of White Wolf since they own the property and Onyx Path licenses it out from them. If it ever does happen, pre-made adventures (or maybe even adventure paths?) would be one of the first things I'd write.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-28T09:21:49-07:00","id":1230834,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1228767-premade-scenarios?p=1229027#post1229027\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've ported a handful of 1e SAS stories to 2e, it's mostly pretty straightforward to do. That said, I'd love to see more new scenarios written specifically for 2e.</div> </div> </div> </div>For those of us really green with the system, can you explain how you do that?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24020-mateus","name":"Mateus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24020_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"55"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-28T11:40:54-07:00","id":1230877,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1228767-premade-scenarios?p=1230834#post1230834\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For those of us really green with the system, can you explain how you do that?</div> </div> </div> </div>Sure. Since 1e and 2e use the same basic set of attributes and skills, most of the NPC stats can be used in either edition with few to no changes. Weapons and armor work a little differently between editions, so if an NPC has any, you\u2019ll want to check the CofD core book and/or Hurt Locker for a 2e equivalent. If none exists, reduce the damage of a weapon by 1 (to a minimum of 0), change it to lethal if it does bashing, and compare to similar 2e weapons to get an idea of what the initiative modifier should be. Most Merits will also have a 2e equivalent (and many are identical between editions).<br /> <br /> The biggest thing you\u2019ll need to consider is Conditions. If there are any special effects that can linger on the PCs in the adventure, they should be made into Conditions, and there are two ways to go about doing that. Either look for a Condition that already exists and represents a narratively similar effect and use that, disregarding the specific mechanical effects, or make a new Condition with the same mechanical effect and add a resolution and/or Beat criteria.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-28T12:22:45-07:00","id":1230888,"title":"","content":"2e doesn't have that many changes to the core systems, aside from the supernatural powers, like Charlaquin said. Another thing that's easy to miss (and simple to convert) is in 2e Athletics adds to Defense. So you would add Athletics to Defense on premade characters.<br /> <br /> Many SAS already detail the powers things have, like Parlor Games has write-ups for the Leatherworker's special Dread Powers right under his write-up. Paraphrasing here but, 'Pedipalps add a +1 to Bite and grapple Rolls and can inject a Toxicity 7 venom with a successful Bite attack.' So you can keep the +1 to rolls, then have the Bite cause the Poisoned Tilt (likely Grave, since 7 is pretty nasty poison).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-29T13:23:14-07:00","id":1231198,"title":"","content":"Thank you Charlaquin &amp; nofather!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24020-mateus","name":"Mateus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24020_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"55"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}